# Start: a transfer page, focus on SAVES. End: same page, focus on SAVES,
# the SETTINGS switch flipped. Rows: SAVES, ROMS AND BIOS, GAME CONTENT,
# SETTINGS -- three down from SAVES. Flip, not set: the row remembers its
# last state, so read the frame.
# The switch press takes no re-send (see tick-roms.steps).
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key x
wait-for-change 12 0
settle
shot settings-flipped
key up
wait-for-change
key up
wait-for-change
key up
wait-for-change
